SUMMARY:Mocktails & Meaning™: Understanding Vision Loss
DESCRIPTION:How can we support independence and make our communities more accessible for people experiencing vision loss? \nOur November Mocktails & Meaning™ features Jennifer Eaton\, COA member and Manager of Youth Services at VisionCorps\, for a conversation about the causes of vision loss\, living independently\, and how we can better support one another. \n📅 Thursday\, November 19\n⏰ 6:30 PM\n📍 Narthex\, Church of the Apostles UCC\n🍎🍹 Mocktail: Apple Cider Mock Sangria \n💬 Come curious and leave with a better understanding! \n👉 Learn more or register: https://onrealm.org/apostlesucc/PublicRegistrations/Event?linkString=NTg5MzA5NTgtOWQyNi00NjMzLTllOTQtYjRmZDAwZWMxMDEy 
URL:https://apostlesucc.org/event/mocktails-meaning-understanding-vision-loss/
LOCATION:Church of the Apostles UCC\, 1850 Marietta Ave\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://apostlesucc.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Mocktails-Meaning-Flyer-Banner-Landscape-1-1-scaled.png
END:VEVENT
