SUMMARY:Inclusive Church Team Meeting
DESCRIPTION:The Inclusive Church Team is committed to fostering a congregation that truly reflects our vision of compassionate justice and inclusive refuge. By exploring ways to become more open and affirming\, we strive to ensure that everyone\, regardless of background\, identity\, or experience\, feels welcomed and valued in our community. Our focus extends to engaging with and supporting minority groups in the Lancaster area\, building meaningful relationships\, and creating spaces where all can thrive. Through intentional efforts\, we aim to grow as a church that celebrates diversity and lives out God’s love for all people.\nTeam Lead: Cathy Kenlin
URL:https://apostlesucc.org/event/inclusive-church-team-meeting-4/
LOCATION:Church of the Apostles UCC\, 1850 Marietta Ave\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
END:VEVENT
