SUMMARY:Breakfast with Santa & Holiday Bazaar
DESCRIPTION:Church of the Apostles and the American Cancer Society Relay for Life are teaming up for a festive morning of Breakfast with Santa and a Holiday Bazaar on Saturday\, December 12! \nWe’re making this year’s event bigger and better\, with kids’ crafts and fun games provided by COA while parents browse a variety of local vendors throughout Fellowship Hall and our West Wing Lobby. And\, of course\, Santa will make his grand arrival by fire truck at 9 AM! 🚒🎅 \nDoors open at 8:45 AM. Breakfast will be served by wonderful American Cancer Society volunteers from 9–11 AM\, with photos with Santa\, crafts\, raffles\, and the Holiday Bazaar continuing until noon. \nBreakfast:\n• Adults and ages 13+: $12\n• Children ages 2–12: $7\n• Children under 2: Free \nThe Holiday Bazaar is free to attend\, and breakfast proceeds benefit the American Cancer Society Relay for Life of Lancaster County. \nCome hungry\, bring the kids\, and get your holiday season started with a morning of food\, fun\, shopping\, and Santa! 🎄
URL:https://apostlesucc.org/event/breakfast-with-santa-holiday-bazaar/
LOCATION:Church of the Apostles UCC\, 1850 Marietta Ave\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://apostlesucc.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/833276169_10240691246611136_2809082699251037765_n.jpg
END:VEVENT
