SUMMARY:Blue Christmas Service
DESCRIPTION:Christmas does not feel the same for everyone. Grief\, loss\, financial strain\, difficult relationships\, political division\, or other challenges can make the season feel complicated. On Wednesday\, Dec. 16th at 7 PM in the Sanctuary\, Rev. Kuhn and Music Director Lars Potteiger will lead our annual Blue Christmas service. Together\, we’ll make space for the things we carry while also sharing in the quiet joy of the season and remembering the gift of Jesus Christ.
URL:https://apostlesucc.org/event/blue-christmas-service/
LOCATION:Church of the Apostles UCC\, 1850 Marietta Ave\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17603\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://apostlesucc.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Blue-Christmas-Service-2026.jpg
END:VEVENT
