SUMMARY:Apostles Academy Concerts: Bill Hager
DESCRIPTION:Storyteller\, author\, and photographer Bill Hager returns this season with a special Double Feature presentation of Misunderstood and Raven’s Wish. Through storytelling and photography\, Bill brings his subjects and stories to life in a presentation that promises to spark imagination\, curiosity\, and conversation. Experience this unique afternoon on Sunday\, April 11\, 2027\, at 3 PM!
