SUMMARY:Apostles Academy Concerts: Lancaster Flute Ensemble
DESCRIPTION:A collection of flutes comes together in harmony as the Lancaster Flute Ensemble fills the Sanctuary with bright\, playful\, and expressive music. Featuring the unique sounds and range of the flute family\, this concert is sure to offer a delightful afternoon for music lovers of all ages. Hear them on Sunday\, May 16\, 2027\, at 3 PM!
